- *Teaching Fellow*, ES 150: Probability with Engineering Applications, Spring 2022, 2024, and 2025. Received the *Excellent Teaching Award*.
- *Teaching Fellow*, AM/ES 158: Introduction to Optimal Control and Estimation, Fall 2023.

== University of Science and Technology of China

